  "title": "California Grilled Veggie Sandwich",
  "description": "For a smoky and sumptuous veggie-filled grilled sandwich, try this easy recipe. All it takes is some veggies, focaccia bread, lemon-mayonnaise dressing, and crumbled feta.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
